1 REM FBCS SEG-0524
2 REM CLAIM A-9.1.2-TR137
3 REM TYPE OUTPUT
4 REM 9.1.2 l.4201-4205, 13.5.2 l.10514-10518: an EXTERNAL picture declares the external FUNCTION it uses in its own lines;
5 REM the declare-statement belongs to the program-unit of the picture.
10 DECLARE EXTERNAL PICTURE P
20 DRAW P
30 END
100 EXTERNAL PICTURE P
110 DECLARE EXTERNAL FUNCTION F
120 PRINT F(2)
130 END PICTURE
200 EXTERNAL FUNCTION F(X)
210 LET F = X * X + 1
220 END FUNCTION
